./ R 01194000          $ 01194100 010                                           
IOSTCAW  ST    R2,CAW         KEPT -- SEE BELOW                XA0004DK         
*  THE CAW STORE STAYS. 1,917 CAW AND CSW REFERENCES ACROSS    XA0004DK         
*  CP KEEP READING BOTH, AND IOSXCC1 BELOW KEEPS THE CSW       XA0004DK         
*  HONEST. THAT IS THE PREMISE OF THE WHOLE I/O CONVERSION:    XA0004DK         
*  CHANGE THE TEN INSTRUCTIONS, NOT THE 1,917 REFERENCES.      XA0004DK         
         MVC   IOBORB,ORBTMPL BUILD THE ORB -- IMPLICIT L'32   XA0004DK         
         ST    R2,IOBOCCW     CCW ADDRESS FOR THIS OPERATION   XA0004DK         
./ R 01206000          $ 01206100 010                                           
*  SIO TOOK THE DEVICE ADDRESS IN R1 AND IGNORED ITS OPERAND.  XA0004DK         
*  SSCH TAKES THE SUBSYSTEM ID IN R1 AND THE ORB AS ITS        XA0004DK         
*  OPERAND -- THE TWO SWAP ROLES. THE LH R1,IOBRADD UPSTREAM   XA0004DK         
*  IS LEFT ALONE BECAUSE IOSQTIO STILL WANTS THE DEVICE        XA0004DK         
*  ADDRESS THERE.                                              XA0004DK         
         L     R1,RDEVSSID    X'0001' || SUBCHANNEL NUMBER     XA0004DK         
         SSCH  IOBORB         START SUBCHANNEL                 XA0004DK         
./ R 01241000          $ 01241100 010                                           
         BC    4,IOSXCC1      CC 1 = STATUS PENDING, NOT CSW   XA0004DK         
./ R 01263000          $ 01263100 100                                           
         STM   R14,R1,IOBXSAV  ISSUE REQUESTED TEST I/O        XA0004DK         
         BAL   R14,IOSXTIO                                     XA0004DK         
         LM    R14,R1,IOBXSAV                                  XA0004DK         
./ R 01274000          $ 01274100 100                                           
IOSQHIO  STM   R14,R1,IOBXSAV  ISSUE REQUESTED HALT I/O        XA0004DK         
         BAL   R14,IOSXHIO                                     XA0004DK         
         LM    R14,R1,IOBXSAV                                  XA0004DK         
./ R 01356000 01357000 $ 01356100 100                                           
*  THE ONLY MASK CHANGE IN THIS MODULE. BC 2 WAITED ON TIO'S   XA0004DK         
*  CC2, CHANNEL BUSY, WHICH TSCH NEVER RETURNS. THE WAIT       XA0004DK         
*  INTENDED IS UNTIL STATUS IS PRESENT, AND AFTER              XA0004DK         
*  NORMALISATION THAT IS CC1 -- SO LOOP WHILE THE DEVICE       XA0004DK         
*  STILL READS FREE.                                           XA0004DK         
IOSTIO   STM   R14,R1,IOBXSAV  YES - CLEAR STATUS              XA0004DK         
         BAL   R14,IOSXTIO                                     XA0004DK         
         LM    R14,R1,IOBXSAV                                  XA0004DK         
         BC    8,IOSTIO       WAIT UNTIL STATUS IS THERE       XA0004DK         
./ R 01480000          $ 01480100 100                                           
         CR    R1,R1          ALWAYS AVAILABLE: SETS CC0       XA0004DK         
./ R 01489000          $ 01489100 100                                           
TESTCHAN CR    R1,R1          ALWAYS AVAILABLE: SETS CC0       XA0004DK         
./ R 01525000          $ 01525100 100                                           
HIORLOOP STM   R14,R1,IOBXSAV  TRY AGAIN TO HALT IT            XA0004DK         
         BAL   R14,IOSXHIO                                     XA0004DK         
         LM    R14,R1,IOBXSAV                                  XA0004DK         
./ R 01563000          $ 01563010 010                                           
*  WAS LCTL C2,C2,TEMPSAVE. CR2 IS THE DUCT ORIGIN ON          XA0004DK         
*  ESA/390, NOT A CHANNEL MASK, AND THERE IS NO PER-CHANNEL    XA0004DK         
*  MASK TO PUT IT IN INSTEAD. THE STCTL AND THE ARITHMETIC     XA0004DK         
*  ABOVE ARE HARMLESS AND STAY, SO NO LABEL MOVES. DISABLING   XA0004DK         
*  A FAILING CHANNEL DURING CHANNEL-CHECK RECOVERY: THE        XA0004DK         
*  CHANNEL SUBSYSTEM OWNS PATH RECOVERY NOW.                   XA0004DK         
         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE. I-73.          XA0004DK         
./ R 01585000          $ 01585010 010                                           
*  WAS LCTL C2,C2,TEMPSAVE. CR2 IS THE DUCT ORIGIN ON          XA0004DK         
*  ESA/390, NOT A CHANNEL MASK, AND THERE IS NO PER-CHANNEL    XA0004DK         
*  MASK TO PUT IT IN INSTEAD. THE STCTL AND THE ARITHMETIC     XA0004DK         
*  ABOVE ARE HARMLESS AND STAY, SO NO LABEL MOVES. REENABLING  XA0004DK         
*  IT AFTERWARDS.                                              XA0004DK         
         DS    0H             THE LCTL IS GONE. I-73.          XA0004DK         
./ R 02617000          $ 02617100 100                                           
         STM   R14,R1,IOBXSAV  SEE IF IT'S REALLY BUSY         XA0004DK         
         BAL   R14,IOSXTIO                                     XA0004DK         
         LM    R14,R1,IOBXSAV                                  XA0004DK         
./ R 02627250          $ 02627260 010                                           
         STM   R14,R1,IOBXSAV  IS IT BUSY ?                    XA0004DK         
         BAL   R14,IOSXTIO                                     XA0004DK         
         LM    R14,R1,IOBXSAV                                  XA0004DK         
./ I 02651100 $ 02651110 010                                                    
*  ORB TEMPLATE. EVERYTHING EXCEPT THE CCW ADDRESS, WHICH      XA0004DK         
*  IOSTCAW STORES. LPM MUST BE X'80': SSCH TESTS ORB.LPM       XA0004DK         
*  AGAINST PMCW.PAM AND PAM IS X'80', SO A ZERO LPM MEANS NO   XA0004DK         
*  PATH AVAILABLE RATHER THAN ANY PATH, AND SSCH THEN RETURNS  XA0004DK         
*  CONDITION CODE 3 WITH NO DIAGNOSTIC OF ANY KIND. THAT COST  XA0004DK         
*  A CYCLE IN THE BARE-METAL TESTS.                            XA0004DK         
         DS    0F                                              XA0004DK         
ORBTMPL  DC    1F'0'          INTERRUPTION PARAMETER           XA0004DK         
         DC    X'00'          FLAG4: KEY ZERO                  XA0004DK         
         DC    AL1(ORBCCWFM)  FLAG5: CCW FORMAT -- R-27        XA0004DK         
         DC    AL1(ORBLPMOK)  LPM -- MUST BE X'80'             XA0004DK         
         DC    X'00'          FLAG7                            XA0004DK         
         DC    6F'0'          CCW ADDRESS AND PAD              XA0004DK         
         SPACE 1                                               XA0004DK         
*  IOSXCC1 IS THE CSW SHIM. SIO CONDITION CODE 1 MEANT HERE    XA0004DK         
*  IS YOUR CSW, NOW. SSCH CONDITION CODE 1 MEANS STATUS IS     XA0004DK         
*  PENDING, GO AND FETCH IT. SO TSCH THE IRB, SYNTHESISE A     XA0004DK         
*  CSW AT X'40' FROM THE SCSW, AND JOIN THE ORIGINAL PATH. NO  XA0004DK         
*  REGISTER IS USED: THE IOBLOK BASE IN R10 AND THE PSA BASE   XA0004DK         
*  IN R0 ARE BOTH ALREADY ESTABLISHED.                         XA0004DK         
         SPACE 1                                               XA0004DK         
*  CSW BYTE 0 IS SET TO ZERO, WHICH LEAVES THE LOGOUT-PENDING  XA0004DK         
*  BIT X'04' ALWAYS OFF, SO EVERY TM CSW,X'04' IN CP FALLS     XA0004DK         
*  THROUGH. THE ESA/390 REPLACEMENT FOR CHANNEL LOGOUT IS THE  XA0004DK         
*  ESW AND ERW IN THE IRB PLUS STCRW, AND THAT BELONGS TO      XA0004DK         
*  RISK R-03 AND NOT TO M1. STUBBING IT THIS WAY LOSES ERROR   XA0004DK         
*  DETAIL; IT DOES NOT INVENT ANY, WHICH IS THE SAFE           XA0004DK         
*  DIRECTION TO FAIL.                                          XA0004DK         
         SPACE 1                                               XA0004DK         
*  THE CCW ADDRESS IS COPIED STRAIGHT ACROSS. S/370 DEFINED    XA0004DK         
*  THE CSW ADDRESS AS EIGHT PAST THE LAST CCW USED; WHETHER    XA0004DK         
*  THE SCSW USES THE SAME CONVENTION FOR EVERY STATUS TYPE IS  XA0004DK         
*  NOT YET CHECKED, AND M1 READS STATUS BYTES RATHER THAN      XA0004DK         
*  THIS ADDRESS. TO BE SETTLED BEFORE ANY CODE RELIES ON THE   XA0004DK         
*  VALUE.                                                      XA0004DK         
         SPACE 1                                               XA0004DK         
IOSXCC1  DS    0H             ESA/390 CC 1: STATUS PENDING     XA0004DK         
         TSCH  IOBIRB         FETCH IT, CLEAR THE SUBCHANNEL   XA0004DK         
         MVI   CSW,X'00'      KEY ZERO, LOGOUT NEVER PENDING   XA0004DK         
         MVC   CSW+4(4),IOBIDST STATUS AND RESIDUAL COUNT      XA0004DK         
         MVC   CSW+1(3),IOBICCW+1 CCW ADDRESS, LOW 3 BYTES     XA0004DK         
         B     IOSCC1         NOW PROCEED AS S/370 DID         XA0004DK         
         SPACE 1                                               XA0004DK         
*  IOSXTIO NORMALISES TSCH BACK TO TIO'S CONDITION CODES. TIO  XA0004DK         
*  CCTHE DEVICE WAS FREE; TSCH CC1 MEANS NOTHING IS PENDING,   XA0004DK         
*  WHICHSAME FACT WITH THE OPPOSITE CODE. WHEN STATUS IS       XA0004DK         
*  PRESENT A CSBUILT AT X'40' SO EVERY TM CSW+4 AROUND THE     XA0004DK         
*  CALL SITES STILL                                            XA0004DK         
         SPACE 1                                               XA0004DK         
IOSXTIO  DS    0H             TSCH, WITH TIO'S CONDITION CODE  XA0004DK         
         L     R1,RDEVSSID    X'0001' || SUBCHANNEL NUMBER     XA0004DK         
         TSCH  IOBIRB         TEST SUBCHANNEL                  XA0004DK         
         BC    4,IOSXTIOF     CC1: NOTHING PENDING = FREE      XA0004DK         
         BC    3,IOSXTIOX     CC2 AND CC3 PASS THROUGH         XA0004DK         
         MVI   CSW,X'00'      BUILD THE CSW THE CALLER EXPECT  XA0004DK         
         MVC   CSW+1(3),IOBICCW+1  CCW ADDRESS                 XA0004DK         
         MVC   CSW+4(4),IOBIDST  STATUS AND COUNT              XA0004DK         
         LA    R15,1          TELL THE CALLER CSW STORED,      XA0004DK         
         LCR   R15,R15        WHICH IS CC1. LTR WOULD GIVE CC  XA0004DK         
         BR    R14                                             XA0004DK         
IOSXTIOF DS    0H             DEVICE FREE: TIO CALLED THAT CC  XA0004DK         
         SR    R15,R15        ZERO RESULT, SO CC0              XA0004DK         
IOSXTIOX DS    0H                                              XA0004DK         
         BR    R14                                             XA0004DK         
         SPACE 1                                               XA0004DK         
IOSXHIO  DS    0H             HSCH REPLACES HIO AND HDV ALIKE  XA0004DK         
*  THE DISTINCTION WAS BETWEEN HALTING A CHANNEL AND HALTING   XA0004DK         
*  DEVICE, AND A SUBCHANNEL IS ALWAYS EXACTLY ONE DEVICE. THE  XA0004DK         
*  CONDITION CODES ALREADY AGREE CLOSELY ENOUGH THAT THE       XA0004DK         
*  BC 8+2+1 MASKS AT THE CALL SITES ARE LEFT ALONE.            XA0004DK         
         L     R1,RDEVSSID    X'0001' || SUBCHANNEL NUMBER     XA0004DK         
         HSCH  0              HALT SUBCHANNEL                  XA0004DK         
         BR    R14                                             XA0004DK         
         SPACE 1                                               XA0004DK         
IOSXSIO  DS    0H             SSCH FOR THE SENSE PATH          XA0004DK         
         MVC   IOBORB,ORBTMPL BUILD THE ORB                    XA0004DK         
         MVC   IOBOCCW,CAW    CCW ADDRESS THE CALLER SET       XA0004DK         
         L     R1,RDEVSSID    X'0001' || SUBCHANNEL NUMBER     XA0004DK         
         SSCH  IOBORB         START SUBCHANNEL                 XA0004DK         
         BR    R14                                             XA0004DK         
./ R 02654000          $ 02654100 100                                           
IOSNSIO  STM   R14,R1,IOBXSAV  ATTEMPT TO DO SENSE             XA0004DK         
         BAL   R14,IOSXSIO                                     XA0004DK         
         LM    R14,R1,IOBXSAV                                  XA0004DK         
./ I 02801000 $ 02801500 100                                                    
         COPY  XABLOKS        ESA/390 CHANNEL SUBSYS BLOCKS    XA0004DK         
